Description: Provides tools to decompose health inequality using regression-based,
    nonlinear, and concentration-index-based methods. The package is designed for
    applied health inequality monitoring and public health research, with support
    for complex survey designs, model diagnostics, grouped decomposition outputs,
    and reproducible statistical workflows.
